  "description": "OYA is designed for relaxed days at sea, where every moment flows naturally between comfort, dining, and time on the water. This 2025 Sunreef 60 sailing catamaran welcomes up to eight guests in four cabins, including a beautiful master suite, with a dedicated crew of four ensuring a smooth and personalised charter experience.\n\nHer open layout makes her ideal for a Mediterranean itinerary, with generous spaces for every part of the day. Guests can enjoy shaded alfresco dining on the aft deck, easy access to the sea from the swim platform, and quiet moments on the foredeck lounge. The 36m² flybridge offers the perfect setting for sunbathing, sunset drinks, or simply taking in the views while cruising between destinations.\n\nInside, OYA’s dark interior tones create a calm and elegant atmosphere, offering a peaceful retreat after a day spent exploring, swimming, or enjoying water activities. With her balance of space, style, and comfort, OYA is a strong choice for families or groups looking for a refined sailing catamaran charter.",
